    "name": "wf-text-0",
    "data": "\"<p>An access request has been approved for $value -case(property'hrcomp:Employee First Name')$ $value -case(property'hrcomp:Employee Last Name')$. If the person that approved the request left comments, they are shown below.&nbsp;<br><br><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Management Comments</span><br><br>$value -case(property'hrcomp:Management Comments')$<br><br></p>\\n<h1>User Access Request</h1>\\n<p>New or revised user access has been requested for the person listed below. For new users, use their job title to determine the appropriate access. For changes to user access, ensure the new access rights do not create a segregation of duties issue.<br><br><strong>User's Name:</strong> &nbsp;$value -case(property'hrcomp:Employee First Name')$ $value -case(property'hrcomp:Employee Last Name')$<br><strong>Job Title:</strong> $value -case(property'hrcomp:Job Title')$<br><strong>Additional Access Needed:</strong> $value -case(property'hrcomp:Additional Access Needed')$<br><strong>Date Change is Required:</strong> $value -case(property'hrcomp:Date Requested')$<br><strong>Badge Number:</strong> $value -case(property'hrcomp:Badge Number')$</p>\""
